00:11:09.367 --> 00:11:12.200
Sorry! I'm sorry.
[ Laughter ]

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.534
This is really serious.

00:11:13.534 --> 00:11:16.767
-Yeah, it really was.
-Okay.

00:11:16.767 --> 00:11:18.234
You have to say --
When you say go.

00:11:18.234 --> 00:11:20.133
